# This repo is a bundle of Markdown agent definitions. Linguist treats Markdown as prose and
# excludes it from the language stats by default, which left the small codex/ Python tooling to
# dominate the language bar. Count the Markdown that is the actual content, and treat the codex/
# mirror tooling (a secondary export target) as vendored so it doesn't skew the stats.
*.md linguist-detectable=true
codex/** linguist-vendored
